496683402", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75411996_673505500016735_2170965674423752804_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=io8F_JX_g-sQ7kNvwF-3svz&_nc_oc=AdqXOwplNhSq7Q2Rr8e-CUGnVqRMTb-_SIFZH36mgd7Te9e-GXI6b7m-EP1j9X8oVOA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRodrkz1s4w1xmKO-5d8pt6uLDnSb33bg3pHHIXk0nB_w&oe=6AF0B4AB"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "VR Battle of Battleship", "keywords": [], "long_description": "1. Basic Operation:\n- You can start the battle by firing the main guns of the battleship.\n- The following modern weapons are added to increase the tension of the game:\n    - Your battleship has CIWS Beam for defense\n    - Enemy battleship has Anti-ship missiles\n\n2. The Physical Law Modification:\nTo realize the short-time and amazing spectacle battle of huge battleships, some of the physical laws in this Real-Time Simulation World are carefully modified.\n\n3. Conclusion:\nWe believe that the amazing spectacle battle of the huge battleship in VR world is established by the\nunique modification of the physical laws in this application.\nPlease enjoy this VR real-time simulation of battle of battleship.\n\nNull City Realtime Simulation, Development Team", "short_description": "\u201cVR Battle of Battleship\u201d is a Real-Time Simulation Game of the one-on-one fight of the Ultimate Huge Battleships; IOWA-class and Yamato-class in VR world.\nFrom the beginning of this application, you can choose IOWA or YAMATO and start the battle.\nLet fire the main guns of your huge battleships!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.nullcityrts.com/privacypolicy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "NullCityRTS", "support_website_url": "https://www.nullcityrts.com/contact", "website_url": "https://www.nullcityrts.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_c